[en.FOCUS_C08_SOURCE_OF_SIN]
Source of Sin

[en.FOCUS_C08_SOURCE_OF_SIN_desc]
The slavery that once only existed in stories, legends, or perhaps another world, has actually appeared in Manehattan.\n\nThe so-called "Business Alliance" is actually a collection of sinners, devouring ordinary ponies. And the source of sin is the Gladmane who sits on the throne of power in Manehattan. What has he done? What is the actual life of the ponies like?\n\n§RAll the sins on this land, will eventually be revealed by us.§!

[en.FOCUS_C08_SOURCE_OF_SIN_TOOLTIP]
Unlock a series of decisions in §YStarlight Radio§!: §YManehattan Raid§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_SOURCE_OF_SIN]
罪恶本源

[zh.FOCUS_C08_SOURCE_OF_SIN_desc]
只在故事和传说中，或许另一个世界中出现的奴隶制，竟然真的出现在了马哈顿。\n\n所谓“商业联盟”，实际是罪恶的融合体，吞噬着普通的小马们。而罪恶的源头，就是安坐在马哈顿权利宝座上的乐善。他到底做了什么？小马们的实际生活怎么样？\n\n§R这片土地上的罪恶，终将被我们揭晓。§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_SOURCE_OF_SIN_TOOLTIP]
解锁§Y星光电台§!中的系列决议：§Y突袭马哈顿§!

